00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:41.400
Oh no. Oh no.

00:19:41.760 --> 00:19:43.280
Oh, no.

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:48.360
Ohhh, no, the bandits are sssooo horrendous.

00:19:48.360 --> 00:19:53.380
"Military communication is through the radio, we're sure... it was signal to evacuate out of here, but turns they need our help."

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:55.280
"Need chop down a tree or two."

00:19:55.280 --> 00:19:57.300
I can't DO that!

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:59.460
I don't have what I NEED!

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:01.160
I don't HAVE that!

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:02.660
Just KILL me!

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:05.000
End this torment!

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:06.180
End it!

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:08.020
Ohhhhhh, just end it!

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:10.040
THE RAIDERS ARE BACK!

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:11.640
OH NOOOO!

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:14.000
OOHHHHH, THEY TOOK DOLORES!

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:17.480
OH, GODDAMMIT, THEY TOOK DOLORES!

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:18.940
Ah, fuck.

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:21.320
Welp... that's not good.

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:24.560
I DID show 'em a show of force!

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:25.320
*sniffle*

00:20:25.720 --> 00:20:27.900
Then my thing blew up!

00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:30.120
Well, plenty of food and water for him.

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:31.960
Oh, no, it's the letter!

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:34.140
I don't think- I don't think so!

00:20:34.140 --> 00:20:38.980
If I'm gonna die, I'm gonna die alone in my shelter without my family.

00:20:38.980 --> 00:20:40.480
Oh, boy. Welp.

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:42.080
Bandits are at the door again.

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:44.140
Of course they're at the door again.

00:20:44.140 --> 00:20:45.700
Why wouldn't they-? I'm- yup.

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:48.460
I'm fucking dead, they shot me in my face.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:51.360
Good fucking god. *frustrated laughter*

00:20:51.360 --> 00:20:55.720
"We thought these bandits would just kill us all, but instead they grabbed Ted and took him away at gunpoint."

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:57.700
"We hope nothing bad happened to him."

00:20:57.700 --> 00:21:00.880
Well technically, maybe I'm not dead!

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:03.320
Maybe I just got sold as a slave!

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:04.600
That's great!

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:05.720
Aw, fuck.

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:07.420
*loud groaning into hands*

00:21:07.420 --> 00:21:11.020
Welp! That went about as much as I expected it to be.

00:21:11.020 --> 00:21:13.200
I... can't win at this one.

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:18.180
No matter how good I think I'm going, no matter how well I think I'm doing,

00:21:18.180 --> 00:21:19.980
I will always fail.

00:21:19.980 --> 00:21:22.600
And that is just the life that I live in this game.

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:23.460
But either way!

00:21:23.460 --> 00:21:25.040
Thank you all so much for watching.

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:26.940
I don't think I'm ever gonna win at this game.

00:21:26.940 --> 00:21:31.240
But there's more DLC on the way, so maybe I'll try it again when that new DLC comes out.

00:21:31.240 --> 00:21:32.560
But until then...

00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:40.220
I am left to my own devices, and I am left alone and scared with all my family members being grabbed up by BANDITS!

00:21:40.220 --> 00:21:41.920
So thank you, again, everybody for watching,

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:44.580
and if you got any tips or tricks for me,

00:21:44.580 --> 00:21:46.000
write 'em down in the comments below.

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:47.680
So thanks again, and as always,

00:21:47.680 --> 00:21:50.080
I will see you... in the next video.

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:51.520
Buh-byeee!

00:21:51.520 --> 00:21:53.720
[Outro Music Plays at Full]

